Task 1 — SELECT and WHERE
Find all customers from Karachi who are younger than 30. 
Show only their name and age.

SELECT
    name,
    city
FROM customers 
WHERE city = 'Karachi' AND age < 30;



Task 2 — ORDER BY and LIMIT
Find the top 3 most expensive delivered orders. 
Show order ID, customer ID, product, and amount.
